{"server":"en","storyId":"main_0_level_main_00-10_beg","groupId":"main_0","stageId":"main_00-10","title":"Dilemma","storyCode":"0-10","avgTag":"Before Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6a752ba1bb08444d995cf20c34a32a4fd0ba237f53a6a5e2a82ecce2c00ecb68","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"Nearl's sarcastic tone infuriates Mephisto, and a sniper named Faust demonstrates his outrageous prowess.\nFaust's superb sniping abilities are terrifying, but now that the enemy has shown his hand, there is a way to fight back.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第六关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"What's with this woman..."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"...You there."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"The Reunion forces worked like a well-oiled machine when they took over the Chernobog military strongholds."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"But your men act like deranged thugs."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Mindless slaughter, burning down the city, hunting down innocents... This was all for your own sadistic pleasure, was it not?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Someone base enough to plot these senseless crimes at a time like this... could not possibly have designed the plan to take down an entire city."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Your commander probably ordered you to cause chaos, but you succumbed to your perversion and tastelessness."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"...Faust."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"I want her shot through the mouth."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"*cough* *cough*..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Nearl!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Their sniper... is ridiculous!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"If Nearl gets hit again, she won't be able to defend herself anymore!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Nearl, you need to retreat!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"I can't... He's too powerful. I can't afford to let him hit our squads."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"I have to intercept his attacks!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"She managed to block Faust's ballista... with only a shield--?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Unbelievable... Impossible!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Do it again!! Blow her to pieces!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"--!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"What... it's coming from my right? !"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh no! Hurry, dodge--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"As if I'd let you!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Ace!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Snipers, take aim!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Target the raised platform to the south. Fire!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Faust","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"What?! How dare you... How dare you!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Did we get him?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"I doubt it. The most we can hope for... is to put some pressure on him."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Unfortunately, we don't have the time to dissect our enemies' tactics."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"He's very mobile and has high firepower. The longer this drags on, the less likely we'll be able to block his shots!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"We can't give him time to set up...! Amiya, make your move while Team E3's Snipers keep him occupied!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Team E1 Snipers, come with me and suppress Reunion's forces!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Team E2, use all the firepower you have to break through their defensive line!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"You filthy vermin..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Why won't you just obediently roll over and die?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"Why can't I just put an end to you all right here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mephisto","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"...I want to kill... every... single... one... of you..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ace","speakerId":"char_014_riope","isRemote":false,"text":"Nearl, now's your chance! Hurry!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"All members of Team E4, we're going to break through their formation!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"We're going to clear everything out of our way in one fell swoop!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Let's run wild!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Fire! Fire! Don't let her get any closer..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Huh...?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"What?! She was twenty meters away just a moment ago..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Reunion Member","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"Guhh... Aaarrghh!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"If you wish to stand against a Kazimierz knight, come back after you've trained a few more decades."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Nearl","speakerId":"char_148_nearl","isRemote":false,"text":"Dobermann! Follow me!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Dobermann","speakerId":"char_130_doberm","isRemote":false,"text":"Understood!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_014_riope","aliases":["Ace"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["Reunion Member"]},{"speakerId":"char_130_doberm","aliases":["Dobermann"]},{"speakerId":"char_148_nearl","aliases":["Nearl"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["Mephisto"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["Faust"]}]}
